separate license. Charging no fee does not by itself make a business use
noncommercial. This license does not authorize any investment transaction.

3. Attribution and license retention

When you share any part of the software or a modified version, preserve this
license, the copyright attribution, NOTICE and the required risk notice.
Identify substantial modifications. Do not claim that the original
contributors endorse your version, your service or your conclusions.

4. Required visible risk notice

Required Notice: 投资有风险，分析结果和查询结果不构成投资建议。
Required Notice: Investing involves risk. Analysis and query results do not constitute investment advice.

The Chinese notice above is mandatory. If you use or adapt this software or
its integration/export facilities in an editor, agent, retrieval system or
knowledge base, you must visibly display it with every user-facing query
result and analysis result that the integration produces. Keep it readable
in the result view, generated answer or adjacent persistent result banner.
A hidden metadata field, a collapsed terms page, or a one-time acceptance
dialog alone does not satisfy this condition.

Preserve the notice in every exported record and retrieval chunk, and in
document, CSV, JSON and Markdown exports. Keep the notice when transforming
formats, indexing content or passing retrieved material to another model or
editor. An integration that cannot preserve the notice and display it must
not present those results as a compliant Financial Research Hub integration.

This condition governs permission to use this software and its integration
facilities. It does not create ownership in third-party facts or grant new
rights over third-party content. A repository cannot technically control an
unrelated editor; the integrator is responsible for meeting this condition.

5. Source and data rights

Check each source's access rules, copyright, retention rules and usage terms.
Public availability does not by itself permit bulk collection, storage or
