CAPTCHAs, certificate checks or other access controls. It grants no license
to third-party research reports, datasets or commercial databases.

6. No warranty or investment advice

The software and its results are supplied as is, without warranties to the
extent permitted by law. Information can be delayed, incomplete or wrong.
Query results, analysis results and examples do not constitute investment,
legal or tax advice. You make your own decisions and bear their risks.
Contributors do not guarantee returns, source coverage or uninterrupted
